MijgFBVV95cUxPME44THhTbF9RX2toVENpQWVsTFd1d2FEM19hd0QtbEhPRXBKQmhvT3VoNDdQaGQtZ1BCSExhdHdkZ0t1LTV5LUZxS0VtMVFCUGxvRzQ2V3M5dVVmVjh1MUFzVFdRUzBSZU9ESkVZdXlEUTBRSUxSc3B1NVBWRVA4R0NRVHhwOEJnMzR4eTRB?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"STERIS plc（愛爾蘭）（STE）股票預測"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":4},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-05-29","period":"2026-03-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1757898/000162828026039136/ste-20260331.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"STERIS is a leading global provider of products and services that support patient care with an emphasis on infection prevention. WE HELP OUR CUSTOMERS CREATE A HEALTHIER AND SAFER WORLD by providing innovative healthcare and life science products and services around the globe. We offer our Customers a unique mix of innovative products and services. These include: consumable products, such as detergents, endoscopy accessories, barrier products, instruments and tools; services, including equipment installation and maintenance, microbial reduction of medical devices, instrument and scope repair, laboratory testing, and outsourced reprocessing; capital equipment, such as sterilizers, surgical tables, and automated endoscope reprocessors; and connectivity solutions such as operating room (\"OR\") integration.","zh":"STERIS 是全球領先的產品和服務提供者，支援患者護理，並專注於感染預防。我們透過在全球提供創新的醫療保健和生命科學產品和服務，幫助客戶創造一個更健康、更安全的世界。我們為客戶提供獨特的創新產品和服務組合。其中包括： 消耗品，例如清潔劑、內視鏡配件、屏障產品、儀器和工具；服務，包括設備安裝和維護、醫療器械微生物減少、儀器和示波器維修、實驗室測試和外包再處理；資本設備，例如消毒器、手術台和自動內視鏡清洗機；以及連接解決方案，例如手術室（「OR」）。"},{"en":"We operate and report our financial information in three reportable business segments: Healthcare, Applied Sterilization Technologies (\"AST\"), and Life Sciences. Previously, we had four reportable business segments; however, as a result of the fiscal 2025 divestiture of our Dental segment, Dental is presented as discontinued operations. Historical information has been retrospectively adjusted to exclude discontinued operations for comparability, as required. For more information, refer to Note 4 to our consolidated financial statements titled, \"Discontinued Operations.\" Non-allocated operating costs that support the entire Company and items not indicative of operating trends are excluded from segment operating income. We describe our business segments in the section that follows, titled \"Information Related to Business Segments\" and Note 13 to our consolidated financial statements titled","zh":"我們在三個可報告業務部門營運和報告財務資訊：醫療保健、應用滅菌技術（「AST」）和生命科學。此前，我們有四個可報告業務部門；然而，由於 2025 財年剝離我們的牙科部門，牙科部門被列為已終止業務。根據需要，歷史資訊已進行回顧性調整，以排除已終止的業務以進行比較。欲了解更多資訊，請參閱我們的合併財務報表附註 4，標題為「終止經營」。支援整個公司的非分配營運成本以及不表示營運趨勢的項目不計入分部營運收入。我們在以下標題為「與業務部門相關的資訊」的部分中描述了我們的業務部門，以及我們的合併財務報表附註 13，標題為「與業務部門相關的資訊」。"},{"en":"The bulk of our revenues are derived from healthcare, medical device and pharmaceutical Customers. Much of the growth in these industries is driven by the aging of the population throughout the world, as an increasing number of individuals are entering their prime healthcare consumption years, and is dependent upon advancement in healthcare delivery, acceptance of new technologies, government policies, and general economic conditions.","zh":"我們的大部分收入來自醫療保健、醫療器材和製藥客戶。這些產業的成長很大程度上是由世界各地人口老化所推動的，因為越來越多的人正在進入醫療保健消費的黃金時期，並且依賴醫療保健服務的進步、新技術的接受度、政府政策和總體經濟狀況。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Customer Concentration. Our Healthcare segment sells consumables, services and capital equipment to Customers in many countries throughout the world. For the year ended March 31, 2026, no Customer represented more than 10% of the Healthcare segment's total revenues.","zh":"客戶集中度。我們的醫療保健部門向世界各地許多國家的客戶銷售消耗品、服務和資本設備。截至 2026 年 3 月 31 日的年度，沒有客戶佔醫療保健部門總收入的 10% 以上。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"Healthcare","val":4208600000.0000005,"zh":"醫療保健部門"},{"name":"Applied Sterilization Technologies","val":1138500000,"zh":"應用滅菌技術"},{"name":"Life Science Member","val":588800000,"zh":"生命科學會員"}],"total":5935900000},"prod":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":3060100000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":2875800000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":5935900000},"geo":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":4333800000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Otherforeignlocations","val":1493700000,"zh":"其他國外地點"},{"name":"IE","val":108500000,"zh":"愛爾蘭"}],"total":5935900000}},"peers":["TFX","COO","MTD","WST","RMD"]}}